# Local spec-mirror working copies — `pnpm specs:local <pkg>` materialises the
# mirror repository here when its real one does not exist yet (or when you are
# iterating on a fetch script). Never referenced by committed source; opt in
# per command with DISTILLED_SPECS_LOCAL=1.
packages/*/specs/.local/
